      "normalizedSource": "When declaring a global actor with a custom executor, prefer to implement the underlying actor’s [`unownedExecutor`](actor/unownedexecutor.md) property, and leave this `sharedUnownedExecutor` default implementation in-place as it will simply delegate to the `shared.unownedExecutor`.",
